 right on so many ways  um so we know the numbers are there the  data is there um  that you know the cancellation of  student debt particularly for african  americans  will be a step in the right direction  now again everything that the president  lifted up  on today what came out of the budget  last towards the end of last week before  the memorial day holiday  it's definitely a step in the right  direction but we need to go further and  we can go further and that conversation  is absolutely around  the student debt
 

